[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14341.349, "timestamp": "03:59:01", "text": "不。铃木。啊，铃木。哦，是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14343.59, "timestamp": "03:59:03", "text": "是的。人们对她很刻薄，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14344.87, "timestamp": "03:59:04", "text": "我心想，你他妈的为什么这样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14346.389, "timestamp": "03:59:06", "text": "意思是说，这就像可爱的小动漫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14353.189, "timestamp": "03:59:13", "text": "是的，我想我记得这件事。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14356.95, "timestamp": "03:59:16", "text": "是啊是啊。哦，是祖基吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14359.59, "timestamp": "03:59:19", "text": "也发生过第四代事件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14362.99, "timestamp": "03:59:22", "text": "因为，是啊，是啊。对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14366.07, "timestamp": "03:59:26", "text": "东西。我看到了那些评论，老兄。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14368.95, "timestamp": "03:59:28", "text": "这让我哭了，也让我开始怀疑自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14372.229, "timestamp": "03:59:32", "text": "存在。哇，真是太棒了。是的，4chan 可能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14373.91, "timestamp": "03:59:33", "text": "野蛮。我知道。但当我看到那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14375.67, "timestamp": "03:59:35", "text": "事情就是这样，我就想，“哦，就像……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14377.71, "timestamp": "03:59:37", "text": "这只是个普通的星期二。这他妈是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14379.83, "timestamp": "03:59:39", "text": "正在发生吗？”因为我已经习惯了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14382.309, "timestamp": "03:59:42", "text": "诸如此类的事情。又是一个普通的星期二"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14389.83, "timestamp": "03:59:49", "text": "我。感觉就像，呃，也像当我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14391.79, "timestamp": "03:59:51", "text": "发布内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14394.87, "timestamp": "03:59:54", "text": "与印度动漫相关的某些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14397.55, "timestamp": "03:59:57", "text": "相关内容"}]